## WORKFLOW (first 30 days)
1. Hanna ships technical update → posts internally
2. Nex drafts community post → sends to Tiago for review
3. Tiago approves or edits → Nex posts to Moltbook
4. Community feedback → Nex collects and summarizes for Tiago
5. Continuous loop

## WORKFLOW (after 30 days — if calibration is good)
Autonomous posting allowed for:
- Routine update posts (based on Hanna commits)
- Engagement posts (polls, questions)
- Standard criticism responses

Tiago approval still required for:
- Platform policy discussions
- Security incidents
- Major announcements
- Any post mentioning specific financial numbers

